WEBVTT

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.720
You'll definitely remember, Kaito!

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.200
Seira!

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:15.950
A Midsummer Night's Celebration

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:26.260
My father gave me these, but I don't like this kind of event.{Father gave me these, but I don't like events like this.}

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:28.360
Why don't you ask Hanon-chan to go with you?

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:30.290
If you want, take them.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:32.600
Okay...

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:37.000
"Celebration Night?"

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:40.940
Yeah. It's a celebration full of world-famous performers.

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:44.580
There will be a party and fireworks. It's actually pretty lively.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.340
How wonderful!

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:48.350
I want to go to the party!

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.690
Will there be comedians?

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:51.550
Come on...{Why you...}

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.220
It's way out of reach for ordinary people.{For us ordinary folk, it's way out of our reach.}

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:58.660
If you don't {even }have an invitation, you can't even get into the hotel.

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:00.760
Hey, Hanon!

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:03.880
Eh? Is he Hanon-chan's boyfriend?

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:07.600
Just a minute, Maki-san! How on earth could he be my boyfriend?

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.120
Hey, Hanon. Are you free tonight?

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:14.620
Who knows? If you want to go out with me, you'll need to talk to my agent. {?}{WHAT?!}{what's the issue? it makes sense... -Lexi}

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:19.130
Maybe we can go to a party together with these.{I figured I could go to a party with you with these... }{Maybe I can go to a party with you with these...}

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:22.030
They're invitations to Celebration Night!

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:24.650
I-Invitations to Celebration Night!?

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:29.010
W-Why do you have invitations to Celebration Night?

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:34.610
It doesn't matter. Unless you come, going to such a gorgeous party is no fun.{It doesn't matter. Without you going with me, going to such a gorgeous party is no fun.}

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.530
So, why don't we go to the Celebration Night party {tonight }together?

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.600
Of course I'll go!

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.930
Hanon, you're incredible!

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:46.120
That boy is immature, undependable, and not manly at all.{That boy has an air of a little kid and is undependable. He's not manly at  all!}

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:53.420
But if he really wants me to accompany him to this late night celebration, it's just fine with me, I guess.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.020
Oh, welcome!

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:59.870
Really, what's with Hanon? She's so merciless.{I don't know what to with Hanon. She's so mercenary...}

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:04.190
Hanon never seems to get along with Nagisa-kun. {Hanon never seems to get along with Nagisa as always...}{either "never" or "as always." Pick only one, otherwise it's redundant}

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.510
Hmm...

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:11.340
Hanon knows that Nagisa-kun really likes her, but she treats him badly.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:13.540
I know!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:17.460
Hey, everyone. Let's take this opportunity to make them fall really madly in love with each other.{So, everyone... let us take this opportunity to make them fall really madly in love with each other!}{Ded Bob: Heeeeeey, audience! Audience: Hey, what? -Lexi}

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:18.770
Oh? How?{Hey? What is it?}

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:20.080
What do you mean?

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:25.100
If Nagisa-kun becomes really cool and suddenly every woman likes him, what do you think would happen? {If Nagisa-kun becames really cool all of a sudden and every woman would like him, what do you think would happen?}

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:29.380
I'm certain that it would make Hanon finally pay attention to Nagisa-kun.{Then, I'm certain that Hanon would finally pay attention to Nagisa-kun!}

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:32.510
Eh? I-Is that even going to work?

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:36.070
I don't think Nagisa is going to get surrounded by women all of a sudden.{I don't think Nagisa is going to get slathered with attention from women all of a sudden...}{I don't think Nagisa is going to finally get slathered with attention from women all of a sudden...}

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:38.200
Aha, I see.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.590
Basically, as long as we make Nagisa appear attractive...

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.350
...Hanon will have a better opinion of Nagisa-kun...

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:48.630
...and at tonight's Celebration Night, their hearts just pound with excitement! {Then, tonight's Celebration Night will allow their hearts to just pound with excitement!}

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:53.330
I call this plan "Have Nagisa Profess His Love by the Sea! Operation Attractive!" {Don't name anything ever again, McKay. -Lexi}

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.640
Yay!

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.840
Listen. In the human world, guys who are good at sports are very attractive.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:05.350
I see. Smashing a watermelon blindfolded is a traditional sport by the sea.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.300
A guy who can do this well is very attractive.

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:12.120
Nagisa is coming. Let's get phase one started.{Phase one of the operation begins!}

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.640
Okay!

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:17.920
Nagisa-kun, do you want to come over here and play with us?{Nagisa-kun, want to come over here to play with us?}

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.090
Eh? You're talking to me?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:29.040
They're Hanon's friends. It would be bad to turn them down.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.600
To the right! Further to the right!

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:40.810
Further to the right?

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.090
Right there!{Over here!}

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.030
Nagisa-kun, you're incredible!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.130
Nagisa, you're really good at smashing a watermelon blindfolded!

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:58.660
Wow, guys who can smash watermelons blindfolded are really cool! {Really! Someone really good at smashing watermelons blindfolded is really cool!}

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.670
Oh, no... I-It was nothing...{this isn't much...}

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.250
Is that their plan?

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:09.520
I think Coco and the others are going about this the wrong way.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.910
Why is Nagisa blushing like that?

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.600
Huh?

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.190
I don't care about him at all!

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.750
Now for phase two of the operation.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:28.310
In the human world, courageous guys are very attractive. {In the human world, I'd smack you over the head with a frying pan and put you in the trunk. -Lexi}

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:33.790
So, if we go sit on the banana boat, act scared, and grab onto Nagisa...

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.510
...that should increase courageous Nagisa-kun's appeal!

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.940
Let's go faster!

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:47.550
A banana boat can go this fast...

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.290
This is scary. {That's what you're worried about? -Lexi}

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:52.590
Lucia! Rina! Look!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:56.070
Karen and Coco are holding onto Nagisa-kun really tightly!

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:59.030
Nagisa-kun is a courageous and dependable guy!

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:00.350
How wonderful!

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.850
They're increasing his appeal by showing his courage on a banana boat?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.910
I knew it. Coco and the others are going about this the wrong way. {I knew that Coco and the others are going about this the wrong way...}

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.520
Why does Hanon say that he has the air of a little kid and that he's not dependable?

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.680
I don't understand Hanon's feelings.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.230
I'm going to go wash the dishes.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.710
What is Nagisa trying to do?{What in the fuck is Nagisa trying to do?}{Licca, you may want to consider a course in cutting back on sailor talk... -Jr. Editor Levi}{I agree like WHAT? this is never said on mermaid melody =_=''  ---choco-chan}

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.350
He's said before that he likes me.

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:25.930
Why am I so angry about this?{Why do I have to be angry about this?}

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:28.430
It's not as if he's my boyfriend or anything.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:31.810
"Operation Attractive" is a success for the moment.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:37.570
However, to really get them together for Celebration Night, we'll have to execute an even bigger plan.{However, to get them really together for Celebration Night, we'll have to do a even bigger operation!}

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:39.000
