00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.430
"Confession of Love to Nagisa by the Sea! Operation Jealousy!"

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:45.840
Noelle, you'll be responsible for attaching yourself to Nagisa-kun.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:47.800
