00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.680
This will work for sure!{be effective!} {It's super effective! -Lexi}

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.020
Yay!

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:57.890
I don't know what's going on, but that was really dangerous.{the hell }

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.880
Oww! I sprained my ankle!{Note: You can say "sprained my ankle" for a slight loss in meaning. - Licca}{But saying "ankle" over "foot" is not losing anything critical at all. It may even be that the phrase "sprained my foot" is used in the same corny way in japanese as "sprained my ankle" is in English, in which case the change is actually necessary. -Jr Editor Levi}{Going with ankle... read Wikipedia: sprains happen on joints. -Lexi.}

