00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:12.800
Are you okay?

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:15.240
I want to rent a beach umbrella. {Note: She says "parasol", but you'll see it's actually a beach umbrella... - Licca}

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.110
A beach umbrella?

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.540
