00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.610
I think putting the umbrella over there is better...

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.500
Hanon's friends are giving me so much trouble, but I've got to do my best.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.180
Wow! Look at Noelle!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:44.410
She's got a really good hold on Nagisa!

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:49.300
