00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:58.750
Wow, how daring!

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:02.110
Noelle is actually letting a guy lie in her lap!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:05.120
That means she really likes him!

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:09.030
