00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:19.330
Now, Hanon can admit her own true feelings.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.060
Maybe Hanon...

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.240
...already has feelings towards Nagisa-kun?

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:28.270
I'm so angry! Damn!

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:31.190
Damn damn damn damn damn!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.730
Hanon.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:35.310
Nagisa-kun has gone home to change.

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:36.900
He said he's going to dress up.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:40.320
He says it's very important that he doesn't embarrass the girl he likes on a date.{He says it's very important that he doesn't want to embarrass the girl he likes on a date.}

