He's quite thoughtful.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:48.380
He said he was going to do his best to escort you.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:49.830
He's fired up!{He's all pepped up!}{wtf 'pepped up...'}

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:54.770
He wants to escort me? That unreliable kid is going to do that for me?{He wants to escort me? That unreliable boy with a kid's air is going to do this for me...}

