You understand Nagisa-kun's feelings the best.

00:09:58.150 --> 00:10:00.300
Maki-san said that we can stop for today.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:04.030
Now, you don't want to embarrass Nagisa-kun.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.000
You need to dress up in your most beautiful gown!

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:10.030
I guess I can't help it. I'll go with him.

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:14.520
We've been defeated by the Mermaid Princesses time after time.{every time.}

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:17.340
And we haven't thought of a perfect battle plan.{We can't think of a perfect battle plan.}

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.110
Dammit, it's so stressful.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.180
Sister Mimi, what are you doing?{Sister Mimi... what have you been doing just now?}{pick a verb tense and stick with it @_@}

