Bubble, come on out!

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:53.730
Use your special abilities to scare the humans.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:59.260
Now, I'm going to stand tall and escort Hanon!

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.380
