00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:17.520
What's going on!? {What in the hell is this?}{I know the EXACT meaning is changed, but this is just one part of background chatter that's just supposed to convey "general confusion and fear," so I changed it so that it wouldn't be the same as the previous line. -Jr Editor Levi}

