00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:45.280
You have to become a beautiful woman like me in order to match the summer beach.{You have to become as beautiful a woman as me in order to match the summer beach.}

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:46.910
Damn you, Lanhua!

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:51.620
Are you spouting about your beauty again? What an idiot.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.520
