I won't even look at him any more!{you won't see him anymore? what, are you two dating already? -Lexi}

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:19.150
Uhh, Hanon...

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.430
What happened this afternoon was...

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.310
Hey, Hanon!

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:25.840
Please hear me out, Hanon.

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.710
I don't want to hear your excuses!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:34.550
I'm sorry. To tell you the truth, I lost the invitations to the party.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.420
You were really looking forward to the party. I'm sorry.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:42.630
However, I can't give up this chance to go on a date with you.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:44.690
Therefore, I would like to ask you out again!

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:47.130
Nagisa.

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:49.680
I'll take you out to a great place.{I'm going to take you to a great place.}

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.080
Please cheer up...

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:52.800
...my princess.

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:55.110
W-What kind of idiotic words are you saying?{added Wh- by Primula}

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:57.950
E-Even if you say that...{added Ev- by Primula}{}

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:00.120
Here we go!

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.130
Hey, what do you think you're doing? That was dangerous!

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:09.080
Hanon, you need to face your true feelings.

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:14.520
I'm sorry, Hanon. What happened earlier today was all planned by Coco and the others for show.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.620
It was in hopes that you would pay attention to Nagisa-kun.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:18.890
Eh?

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:22.600
Have a safe trip, Hanon! You two have fun!

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:24.230
Go for it, Nagisa!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.840
I'm sorry, we're almost there. Just wait a little longer.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:52.010
He still has the air of a kid and he's totally undependable.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.640
Hey, you're really sweating.{You're sweating like crazy!}

00:20:57.450 --> 00:20:58.870
T-Thank you, Hanon.{added Th- by Primula}

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:02.380
Goodness. Someone has to take care of you.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:07.490
However, he's always doing his best for me.

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:10.260
Do your best, Nagisa.

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:13.460
Nagisa, over there!

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:25.440
Wow! How pretty!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:28.920
I brought you here to make sure you could see this. {I've brought you here so you can definitely see this.}

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:31.350
How is it? Isn't it a perfect view, Hanon? {?}{asa: zekke - superb view}{Changed from "vista view" to "perfect view" because nagisa's 10 and has probably never even heard the phrase "vista view."}

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:31.970
Yeah!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:35.320
Eh? You look unkempt.{disheveled}

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:42.420
However, Nagisa looks cool when he's unkempt. {However, Nagisa is so cool when he looks dishelveled.}

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:44.560
Nice one, Nagisa!{You're wonderful, Nagisa!}

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:05.560
Hanon! I love you!

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:11.350
You're stupid...

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:54.860
Hippo-sama, I've beeing waiting to see you all this time.

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:58.450
Yuuri-san, I wanted to see you too!

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:01.150
But we're destined never to be together.

00:24:01.150 --> 00:24:04.390
I can only wait for you in the freezing water.

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:06.580
Can the deep sea stop us both?

00:24:06.580 --> 00:24:09.250
However, looking at you for just a moment is enough.

00:24:09.250 --> 00:24:11.450
Please let the two of us meet!

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:15.590
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:15.590 --> 00:24:16.980
Labyrinth of the Stars.

00:24:16.980 --> 00:24:19.220
Please, let time stop for us!{Please! Please stop the time!}
